"Usage: mqtt_publisher [OPTIONS]\n\nOptions:\n      --uauthority <UAUTHORITY>\n          Authority for the local publisher identity and publish source URI [default: authority-a]\n      --uentity <UENTITY>\n          UEntity ID for publish source URI (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x5BA0]\n      --uversion <UVERSION>\n          UEntity major version for publish source URI (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x1]\n      --resource <RESOURCE>\n          Resource ID for publish source URI (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x8001]\n      --broker-uri <BROKER_URI>\n          MQTT broker URI in host:port format [default: localhost:1883]\n      --send-count <SEND_COUNT>\n          Number of publish messages to send before exiting (0 means run forever) [default: 0]\n      --send-interval-ms <SEND_INTERVAL_MS>\n          Milliseconds to wait between publish sends [default: 1000]\n      --encoding <ENCODING>\n          Payload encoding for the classic UMessage payload [default: protobuf] [possible values: native, protobuf, xcdrv2, arrow, omgidl]\n      --payload <PAYLOAD>\n          Text payload used by non-Protobuf example messages [default: mqtt-publisher]\n  -h, --help\n          Print help\n  -V, --version\n          Print version\n"
